                          "title": "Entry Level Software Engineer",
                          "description": "All roles\n\nSan Francisco, CA\n\nEntry Level Software Engineer\n\nSan Francisco, CAFull-timeJunior / Level 2On-site\n\nZof AI is hiring for this role in San Francisco, CA. This is a full-time opportunity for candidates who want to contribute directly to the development of ambitious AI products in a high-performance environment.\n\nStrong interest in AI-native software development required.\n\nCompensation\n\nCompetitive salary\n\nPlus meaningful equity\n\nApply for this role\n\nAbout This Role\n\nZof AI is seeking high-potential Software Engineers who are early in their careers but demonstrate exceptional curiosity, discipline, and learning velocity. This role is designed for builders who want to grow quickly, work closely with senior engineers, use AI tools deeply, and contribute to meaningful product development from the beginning.\n\nResponsibilities\n\nBuild product features with guidance from senior engineers.Use AI tools to accelerate learning and execution.Contribute to frontend, backend, testing, and internal tooling.Participate in code reviews and technical discussions.Improve through fast feedback and disciplined practice.Document work clearly.Take ownership of assigned tasks and deliver with consistency.\n\nRequirements\n\nStrong programming fundamentals.Evidence of projects, internships, open-source work, or self-directed learning.High learning velocity.Strong curiosity about AI and software products.Willingness to use AI tools deeply.Clear communication.Discipline and reliability.Ability to work in a high-performance environment.\n\nNice to have\n\nExperience with TypeScript, React, Next.js, Node.js, Python, Prisma, Postgres, or similar technologies.Experience using Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, or similar AI coding tools.Portfolio or GitHub projects.Interest in AI agents, testing, quality automation, or developer tools.\n\nSoftware EngineeringAI-Native DevelopmentJuniorHigh GrowthProduct Engineering\n\nWhat we provide in San Francisco\n\n MacBook Pro Premium AI development tools Cursor Ultra Claude Code Ultra OpenAI Codex Max or equivalent advanced AI tooling Access to a high-performance AI product environment Close collaboration with leadership, engineering, and customers Opportunity to work in the San Francisco AI ecosystem Wellness and productivity support where applicable Competitive startup environment High ownership Direct product impact\n\nBenefits may depend on role and final offer terms.\n\nApply\n\nApply for Entry Level Software Engineer\n\nThis application is for the Entry Level Software Engineer role in San Francisco, CA. Please complete every required field.\n\nYou are applying for\n\nEntry Level Software Engineer\n\nSan Francisco, CA\n\nCompany website\n\n1\n\nBasic information\n\nFull name*\n\nEmail*\n\nPhone or WhatsApp number*\n\nCurrent location*\n\nCity and country\n\n2\n\nProfessional links\n\nLinkedIn URL*\n\nGitHub URL*\n\nPortfolio or personal website (optional)\n\nResume or CV link*\n\nA link to Google Drive, Dropbox, LinkedIn, your website, or a PDF\n\n3\n\nRole-specific background\n\nYears of experience*\n\nStrongest programming languages\n\nBest project link (optional)\n\nAI tools you use\n\nComfort with frontend\n\nSelect a levelBeginnerIntermediateAdvancedExpert\n\nComfort with backend\n\nSelect a levelBeginnerIntermediateAdvancedExpert\n\nComfort with databases\n\nSelect a levelBeginnerIntermediateAdvancedExpert\n\nComfort with AI coding tools\n\nSelect a levelBeginnerIntermediateAdvancedExpert\n\nSystems or products you have worked on\n\n0/3000\n\n4\n\nLocation fit\n\nAre you able to work from or relocate to the San Francisco area for this role?*\n\nSelect an answerYesOpen to it, with details belowNo\n\nEarliest start date or availability*\n\nRelocation or work authorization note (optional)\n\n5\n\nWritten responses\n\nWhy are you interested in Zof AI?*\n\n0/3000\n\nWhy are you interested in this location?*\n\n0/3000\n\nWhat is the strongest evidence that you would succeed in this role?*\n\n0/3000\n\nWhat is the hardest thing you have built, sold, owned, or led?*\n\n0/3000\n\nHow do you currently use AI tools in your work?*\n\nFor example, describe a project where you used AI tools to build faster, improve quality, or solve a difficult technical problem.\n\n0/3000\n\nHow did you hear about us? (optional)\n\nEducation (optional)\n\nAnything else you would like us to know? (optional)\n\n0/3000\n\n6\n\nFinal confirmation\n\nI understand this is a location-based role and have reviewed the location requirements.*\n\nI confirm that the information I have provided is accurate.*\n\nBy submitting, you agree that Zof AI may store and review your application for hiring purposes.\n\nRelated roles\n\nAccra, GhanaFull-timeJunior / Level 2On-site\n\nEntry Level Software Engineer\n\nZof AI is seeking high-potential Software Engineers who are early in their careers but demonstrate exceptional curiosity, discipline, and learning velocity. This role is designed for builders who want to grow quickly, work closely with senior engineers, use AI tools deeply, and contribute to meaningful product development from the beginning.\n\nGHS 6,500-13,000 / month\n\nSoftware EngineeringAI-Native DevelopmentJuniorHigh GrowthProduct Engineering\n\nView roleApply",
